  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open the camera\n\n3. Change the camera to vertical (portrait)\n\n4. Another user uses emotes in front of the camera (confirmed with the music note and money emotes)\n\n5. The emote in the camera view will be rotated sideways\n\nConfirmed only on PC Desktop mode\n\nThe rotated emotes are also reflected in the image taken as well (not just a UI bug)",
